{
 "$comment": [
  "What RV64 changes from RV32's overlay (rv32gc.json), read by tools/isa/gen-riscv.mjs (loadOverlay):",
  "rows of RV32-only instructions go, `drop` lists RV32's HINT / reserved rows RV64 fills; a row with `replaces` takes the place of that RV32 row,",
  "one with `after` follows that row (a def, or the enc of a HINT / reserved row), the others follow the last row of their group.",
  "groups, formats and extension labels are added; unusedOpcodes replaces RV32's; a register section with `replaces` takes the place of that title.",
  "pseudoInstructions: dropPseudos go, the others replace the one of the same name and asm, or follow `after` (\"name asm\")."
 ],
